{"id":"n1-019","title":"Noun からする (Noun kara suru)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Used to indicate that something is judged, estimated, or considered from a certain point or aspect.","longExplanation":"「Noun + からする」expresses a judgment or estimation based on a particular perspective or aspect. It translates to 'judging from', 'based on', or 'from the viewpoint of' in English, allowing the speaker to form an opinion or conclusion from that point.","formation":"Noun + からする","examples":[{"jp":"彼の態度からすると、彼はその計画に反対しているようだ。","romaji":"Kare no taido kara suru to, kare wa sono keikaku ni hantai shiteiru you da.","en":"Judging from his attitude, he seems to be against the plan.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"態度","vocabId":"1410780","reading":"たいど"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"計画","vocabId":"1252090","reading":"けいかく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"反対","vocabId":"1480670","reading":"はんたい"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"よう","vocabId":"1546200","reading":"よう"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"このレストランの雰囲気からすると、料理もすばらしいはずだ。","romaji":"Kono resutoran no fun'iki kara suru to, ryouri mo subarashii hazu da.","en":"Judging from the atmosphere of this restaurant, the food must be wonderful.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雰囲気","vocabId":"1505070","reading":"ふんいき"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すばらしい","vocabId":"1397300","reading":"すばらしい"},{"surface":"はず","vocabId":"1476430","reading":"はず"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"彼女の成績からすると、彼女は非常に勉強熱心な人でしょう。","romaji":"Kanojo no seiseki kara suru to, kanojo wa hijou ni benkyou nesshin na hito deshou.","en":"Judging from her grades, she must be a very diligent student.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成績","vocabId":"1375760","reading":"せいせき"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"非常","vocabId":"1484920","reading":"ひじょう"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"熱心","vocabId":"1467910","reading":"ねっしん"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"人","vocabId":"1580640","reading":"ひと"},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4]},{"jp":"その会社の成長率からすると、将来的には大きな利益を得られるでしょう。","romaji":"Sono kaisha no seicho-ritsu kara suru to, shouraiteki ni wa ooki na rieki o erareru deshou.","en":"From the company's growth rate, it seems likely to gain substantial profits in the future.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"会社","vocabId":"1198550","reading":"かいしゃ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"成長","vocabId":"1375790","reading":"せいちょう"},{"surface":"率","vocabId":"1551200","reading":"りつ"},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"する","vocabId":"1595910","reading":"する"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"将来","vocabId":"1347710","reading":"しょうらい"},{"surface":"的","vocabId":"1437260","reading":"てき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"大きな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"利益","vocabId":"1549470","reading":"りえき"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得","vocabId":"1454490","reading":"とく","baseForm":"得る"},{"surface":"られる","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でしょ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"です"},{"surface":"う","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6]}]}